OL,3,GNEWSAWell discovered under tram tracks
OL,4,Acauses delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian well has been discovered
OL,7,Fbeneath tram tracks in Sheffield -
OL,8,Fleading to weeks of disruptions for
OL,9,Fpassengers.
OL,11,FThe blue Supertram route has been
OL,12,Fsuspended after the hole was found
OL,13,Funder Birley Lane.
OL,15,FSpecialist engineers are now carrying
OL,16,Fout further studies and reviewing
OL,17,Fhistorical records. Evidence suggests
OL,18,Fthe well dates back to the late 1800s
OL,19,Fand is possibly related to the city's
OL,20,Fcoal mining industry.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
