OL,3,GNEWSAWell discovered under tram tracks
OL,4,Acauses delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire Mayor Oliver Coppard
OL,7,Fsaid he understood how frustrating it
OL,8,Fwas for passengers but safety had to be
OL,9,Fa priority.
